 "stimulus_html": "Employees at a college help desk track the number of people who request assistance each week, as recorded below:\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>142</td>\n<td>153</td>\n<td>158</td>\n<td>156</td>\n<td>141</td>\n<td>143</td>\n<td>155</td>\n<td>167</td>\n<td>143</td>\n<td>168</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>139</td>\n<td>158</td>\n<td>156</td>\n<td>146</td>\n<td>137</td>\n<td>153</td>\n<td>138</td>\n<td>156</td>\n<td>164</td>\n<td>130</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>136</td>\n<td>127</td>\n<td>157</td>\n<td>148</td>\n<td>132</td>\n<td>139</td>\n<td>133</td>\n<td>157</td>\n<td>148</td>\n<td>136</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
