    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>If you already have your data values in a Google Sheet, in another cell type “=AVERAGE(“ and highlight your data values.</p>\n<p>You will see that your mean is 147.2.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<p>147.2</p>"
    }
